file=Legal & Compliance/guard/operational/commands/guard-commands.md · g·c:guard \· commands=> Trigger table mapping natural-language phrases to which guard skill fires. Precedence in `operational/skill/guard-skill-routing.md`.\n\n · tb=\| Phrase pattern \| Fires \| Notes \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| "clearance check" \· "trademark clearance" \· "trademark availability" \· "can we use this mark" \· "knockout search" \· "is this name available" \· "check this mark" \| `ip-routing` → `clearance` \| TM pre-adoption \| · tb=\| "oss review" \· "open source license check" \· "can we ship this library" \· "license compliance check" \· "review our dependencies" \· "copyleft check" \· "AGPL check" \· "SBOM review" \| `ip-routing` → `oss-review` \| OSS compliance \| · tb=\| "infringement check" \· "infringement triage" \· "are they infringing our IP" \· "are we infringing their IP" \· "knockoff surfaced" \· "copycat check" \· "is this a c and d situation" \· "trademark infringement" \· "copyright infringement" \· "patent infringement" \· "trade secret misappropriation" \| `ip-routing` → `infringement-triage` \| Cross-right analysis \| · tb=\| "what IP do we own" \· "list our trademarks" \· "list our domains" \· "list our patents" \· "IP registry" \· "IP inventory" \| `ip-registry` (retrieve) \| State query \| · tb=\| "add this trademark" \· "register this trademark filing" \· "register this domain" \· "register this patent" \| `ip-registry` (mutate) \| Post-clearance / post-issuance recording \| · tb=\| "IP renewal calendar" \· "what's coming up for renewal" \| `ip-registry` (calendar) \| Renewal view \| · tb=\| "retire this IP asset" \| `ip-registry` (retire) \| Abandonment / market exit \| · tb=\| Phrase \| Why ambiguous \| What to ask \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| "trademark this" \| Clearance first OR record post-adoption \| "Do you want a clearance check on a proposed mark, or record a mark you've already adopted/filed?" \| · tb=\| "add this trademark" \| Same ambiguity \| Same \| · tb=\| "IP" (bare noun) \| Registry state OR clearance / infringement analysis \| "Are you asking about existing IP (registry), a new mark (clearance), or an infringement question?" \| · tb=\| "check this library" \| OSS review OR clearance on a library name (trademark) \| "Open source license check, or trademark availability?" \| · ap→:Ambiguous phrasings → ASK, don't guess=Silent picks are defects (playbook §0.5).\n\n · tb=\| Shortcut \| Fires \| Same as \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| `/guard:clearance` \| `ip-routing` → `clearance` \| "trademark clearance" \| · tb=\| `/guard:oss` \| `ip-routing` → `oss-review` \| "OSS license check" \| · tb=\| `/guard:infringe` \| `ip-routing` → `infringement-triage` \| "infringement triage" \| · tb=\| `/guard:registry list` \| `ip-registry` retrieval \| "list our IP" \| · tb=\| `/guard:registry add` \| `ip-registry` Step 1 \| "add this trademark" \| · tb=\| `/guard:registry renew` \| `ip-registry` Step 3 \| "renew [slug]" \| · tb=\| `/guard:calendar` \| `ip-registry` Step 7 \| "IP renewal calendar" \| · pfc:Precedence for cross-skill overlap=Authoritative in `operational/skill/guard-skill-routing.md`. Ambiguous → ASK.\n